### 1. 生成短链
POST http://localhost:8081/api/short-url/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=这是一个测试用的超长链接"
}

### 2. 分页查询
GET http://localhost:8081/api/short-url/list?current=1&size=10

### 3. 短链跳转 (在浏览器中访问 http://localhost:8081/4c9g 测试)
GET http://localhost:8081/4c9g
